{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.MassTheory.SU4SupermultipletGate","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.MassTheory.SU4SupermultipletGate","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Nat.Choose.Basic"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.su4_supermultiplet_present","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.su4_supermultiplet_present","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/SU4SupermultipletGate.lean#L47-L52","doc":"The [1^A] supermultiplet is PRESENT for `A ≤ 4` (nonzero dimension); the\nα-particle `A = 4` is the top closed shell, so the connected [1^4] cluster is\nA=4-LOCAL — exactly the ⁴He-locality the pairwise ceiling measures. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.su4_supermultiplet_vanishes","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.su4_supermultiplet_vanishes","kind":"theorem","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/SU4SupermultipletGate.lean#L42-L45","doc":"The [1^A] supermultiplet VANISHES for `A > 4` (no [1^5]) — the gate. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.su4_supermultiplet_dim_vanishes_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.su4_supermultiplet_dim_vanishes_iff","kind":"theorem","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/SU4SupermultipletGate.lean#L36-L40","doc":"**Orbit-count gate (iff).** The dimension `C(4, A)` of the fully-antisymmetric\n[1^A] Wigner SU(4) supermultiplet vanishes **iff `A > 4`**. ","signatureChunk":0}]}